sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Salesman / Customer / Staff
    actor A as Accountant / Admin
    participant PC as PaymentController
    participant PS as PaymentService
    participant PVS as PaymentVerificationService
    participant PRS as PaymentReversalService
    participant P as Payment Model
    participant I as Invoice Model
    participant O as Order Model
    participant RL as ReceivableLedgerService
    participant GL as JournalMappingService

    Note over S,GL: Step 1: Payment Submission
    S->>PC: POST /salesman/payments (method, amount, evidence)
    PC->>PS: recordPaymentInternal(method, data, evidenceFile, actor)
    PS->>PS: Validate Evidence (RULE-PAY-002: JPEG magic bytes for Cheque/MO)
    PS->>P: Create Payment (PAY-YYYY-MM-XXXX, Status: SUBMITTED)
    PS-->>S: Payment Created & Awaiting Accounting Verification

    Note over A,GL: Step 2: Accounting Verification
    A->>PC: POST /admin/payments/{payment}/verify
    PC->>PVS: verifyPayment(payment, actor)
    PVS->>P: lockForUpdate() -> Status: VERIFIED
    PVS->>I: Update balance_due, payment_status (PAID / PARTIALLY_PAID)
    PVS->>O: Update payment_status (PAID / PARTIALLY_PAID)
    PVS->>RL: recordPaymentPosting(payment) -> AR PAYMENT_RECEIVED
    PVS->>GL: postPaymentReceipt(payment)
    GL-->>PVS: GL Journal Posted (DR 1010/1020 Cash/Bank / CR 1100 AR)
    PVS-->>A: Payment Verified & Accounts Reconciled

    opt Rejection Path
        A->>PC: POST /admin/payments/{payment}/reject (reason, notes)
        PC->>PVS: rejectPayment(payment, actor, reason, notes)
        PVS->>P: Status: REJECTED (Reason Code Recorded)
    end

    opt Reversal Path (Bounced Cheque / NSF)
        A->>PC: POST /admin/payments/{payment}/reverse (reason, notes)
        PC->>PRS: reversePayment(payment, actor, reason, notes)
        PRS->>P: Status: REVERSED
        PRS->>I: Restore balance_due & payment_status
        PRS->>O: Restore order payment_status
        PRS->>GL: postPaymentReversal(payment) -> DR 1100 AR / CR 1010/1020 Cash
    end
